 "First drag an Arrowhead onto the arrow shaft.": "Per prima cosa, trascina una Punta di Freccia sull'asta della freccia.",
 "Line it up with arrow shaft\nto get maximum Durability!": "Allineala con l'asta della freccia per ottenere la massima Resistenza!",
 "Build the Axe Head by attaching all three parts to the center. Drag each blade and spike, and release when it's against the center. Keep them straight to get maximum Power for an Axe.": "Costruisci la Testa dell'Ascia collegando tutte e tre le parti al centro. Trascina ogni lama e spiga, e rilasciale quando sono contro il centro. Mantienile dritte per ottenere la massima Potenza per un'Ascia.",
 "You need to Build the Handle for the Axe. First drag a Pole and drop it onto the axe. Keep it centered for maximum Durability, otherwise it will land crooked!": "Devi costruire l'Impugnatura per l'Ascia. Per prima cosa, trascina un'Asta e rilasciala sull'ascia. Mantienila centrata per la massima Resistenza, altrimenti rimarrà storta!",
 "Drag a Grip and Cap onto the axe to finish the handle.": "Trascina un'Impugnatura e un Pomello sull'ascia per completare l'impugnatura.",
 "Choose a Paint to use on the shield.": "Scegli una Vernice da utilizzare sullo scudo.",
 "Click and drag along the shield to paint the surface. Cover the whole surface for maximum Power, and keep painting until the Paint Meter is empty!": "Clicca e trascina sullo scudo per dipingere la superficie. Copri tutta la superficie per la massima Potenza e continua a dipingere finché il Misuratore di Vernice non è vuoto!",
 "Place a Crest on a shield to finish it. Keep the crest centered for maximum Durability.": "Posiziona uno Stemma su uno scudo per completarlo. Mantienilo centrato per la massima Resistenza.",
 "Drag all of the Pegs onto the Mace head to attach them.": "Trascina tutti i Chiodi sulla testa della Mazza per fissarli.",
 "Try to arrange them like the picture\non the right for maximum Power!": "Cerca di disporli come nell'immagine a destra per la massima Potenza!",
 "You can build an Epic Weapon using the Design you found earlier! Click the Designs book to open it.": "Puoi costruire un'Arma Epica utilizzando il Progetto che hai trovato prima! Clicca sul libro dei Progetti per aprirlo.",
 "All of the Epic Weapon Designs you find are shown here! Click the Bows icon to see your design.": "Qui trovi tutti i progetti d'arma epica che hai scoperto! Clicca sull'icona degli archi per vedere il tuo progetto.",
 "Click on the Design tab to\nsee the recipe for this weapon.": "OK",
 "You can see the parts needed\nto build this weapon, and a\nif you have the parts already.": "Puoi vedere i componenti necessari per creare questa arma e se li possiedi già.",
 "You can see the Bonus Effectthis weapon will give you here.": "OK",
 "You can Bookmark the parts to keep track of what you're saving or building.": "Puoi usare Segna per tenere traccia dei componenti che stai conservando o creando.",
 "Parts that are Bookmarked will show this icon:": "I componenti con Segna mostreranno questa icona:",
 "When you craft great weapons and earn points on a weapon's\nStar Meter, you can unlock extra Elemental Boosts\nfor each weapon type!": "Quando crei armi fantastiche e guadagni punti sul Contatore Stelle di un'arma, puoi sbloccare potenziamenti elementali extra per ogni tipo di arma!",
 "Want to multitask?Click the Back button to take otherweapon orders and switch to other stations!": "OK",
 "Don't worry if you don't reach the\nTreasure Chest each day!": "Non preoccuparti se non raggiungi il Tesoro ogni giorno!",
 "The Design and parts will be available in\nother Treasure Chests during future battles.": "Il progetto e i componenti saranno disponibili in altri Tesori durante le future battaglie.",
 "Message Goes Here": "OK",
 "Scouting and Orders": "OK",
 "As you travel down the road, many different enemies\nwill be blocking your path!": "OK",
 "Your sidekick Scout will run ahead, and let you know\nwhat kind of enemies you will have to face that day.": "OK",
 "Sometimes you will encounter Elemental Enemies that are weak against a certain Elemental Boost. Build weapons that deal extra elemental damage for these enemies!": "OK",
 "Soldiers in the area will help you, but they need weapons first!": "OK",
 "Each soldier is skilled with a certain type of weapon.\nSwordsmen can only use swords,\nand archers can only use bows.": "I soldati sono esperti in un certo tipo di arma. Gli spadaccini possono usare solo spade e gli arcieri solo archi.",
 "Soldiers will wait until you craft a weapon, and will then join\nyou in battle at the end of the day.": "OK",
 "Craft Weapons": "Forgia Armi",
 "Your wagon has four Crafting Stations where you can\nbuild a weapon. You can use any station -- and can use all\nof them at once when multitasking!": "OK",
 "You will unlock three different molds for each type of weapon.Soldiers can use any of the three variations, but eachof them has a different Elemental Boost!": "OK",
 "If you craft a great weapon, that mold's Star Meter\nwill begin to fill up. When the meter is filled, you will unlock\nextra Elemental Boosts for that weapon variation!": "OK",
 "Each type of weapon has a different process for crafting.\nAll weapons need to be forged using your collected metals,\nand some weapons share similar parts (like Grips).": "OK",
 "Stats": "OK",
 "Each weapon has two main stats:": "OK",
 "The Power and Durability for a weapon come from the metal\nyou use to create it. Better metals have higher stats.": "OK",
 "Parts that you collect or buy will also have additional\nStat Boosts, to make your weapon even stronger.": "OK",
 "If you craft a weapon poorly, the stats will go down, and it\nwon't do as well in battle. Craft a great weapon to get the\nmaximum Power and Durability!": "OK",
 "Power": "OK",
 "The weapon's attack strength": "OK",
 "Durability": "OK",
 "How long the weapon lasts before breaking": "OK",
 "If your overall Luck for your group of soldiers is high enough,\nenemies may drop more items and better metals!": "OK",
 "Some parts will have a Luck Stat:": "OK",
 "Weapons and parts can also have Elemental Boostsin addition to their regular stats. Check the \"Element Chart\"section for more information.": "OK",
 "Shop": "OK",
 "Use the Gems you collect ( ) to buy\nweapon parts from Gander’s shop.": "Usa le Gemme che raccogli ( ) per acquistare componenti per armi nel negozio di Gander.",
 "New items are added each day, and old items are removed,\nso keep checking back to find that part you want!": "OK",
 "You can also buy some extra metal ore when it's in stock.": "OK",
 "Gander is a traveling salesman, so he can only carry\none of each part in stock each day.": "Gander è un venditore ambulante, quindi può trasportare solo un pezzo di ogni componente ogni giorno.",
 "Battle": "OK",
 "The soldiers go to battle using your weapons!\nHow well you built the weapons determines how well\nthey’ll perform in battle.": "OK",
 "Monsters will drop loot when attacked.\nMove your mouse over the dropped items to collect them!": "OK",
 "Each weapon’s Durability goes down when it’s used,\nand also goes down when an enemy attacks.\nWhen Durability reaches zero, the weapon will break\nand that soldier will retreat.": "La Resistenza di ogni arma diminuisce quando viene utilizzata e anche quando un nemico attacca. Quando la Resistenza raggiunge lo zero, l'arma si rompe e quel soldato si ritira.",
 "You’ll earn Experience Points (XP) when a monster is defeated,\nand they spray extra loot down the trail.": "OK",
 "View the separate topics in the \"Battle\" section to learn\nmore details about the battle.": "OK",
 "Crafting Swords": "Forgiatura di spade",
 "When your metal is melted, SLOWLY pull the chain downwards\nto pour it into the mold. If you pull too fast, the metal will\nspill and your sword won't form correctly!": "OK",
 "Don't leave your metal melting for too long! If it's overdone,\nthe metal will form cracks when it cools, and not be\nas durable in battle.": "Non lasciare che il metallo si sciolga troppo a lungo! Se si scalda troppo, il metallo si incrinerà quando si raffredda e non sarà resistente in battaglia.",
 "You need to hammer a sword to sharpen its edges.\nClick along the edges of the sword to hammer.": "OK",
 "You can only swing the hammer a certain number of times,\nso try to space out your hammering to make it all the way\naround the blade!": "OK",
 "The Falchion only needs to be sharpened on one side,\nbut you can't swing the hammer as many times.": "La falce deve essere affilata solo su un lato, ma non puoi usare il martello tante volte.",
 "If you hammer poorly, the sword won't have as much\nPower in battle. Hammer evenly around the edges to get\nthe maximum Power for your sword.": "OK",
 "You build the handle of a sword by dropping parts onto it.\nFirst drag and release a GUARD onto the sword's end,\nthen a GRIP, then a CAP.": "OK",
 "If you build the handle crooked, your sword won't have\nas much Durability in battle and will break quickly.\nLine up the parts correctly to get the maximum Durability.": "OK",
 "Crafting Bows": "Forgiare archi",
 "You need to stretch a bow before a soldier can use it.\nDrag both \"arms\" of the bow upwards to stretch the string.\nTry to make it straight to earn the maximum Power for the bow.": "OK",
 "Drag one of your Grips onto the middle of the Bow.\nMany weapons use the same parts, like Grips.": "OK",
 "Drag an Arrowhead onto the arrow shaft.\nLine it up with the arrow shaft to keep it straight\nand get maximum Durability!": "OK",
 "Drag a Fletching onto the other end of the arrow shaft.": "OK",
 "Crafting Axes": "Forgiatura di asce",
 "You need to build the Axe head by attaching all three parts\nto the center.": "Devi assemblare la testa dell'ascia unendo tutte e tre le parti al centro.",
 "Drag each blade and spike, and release when it's against\nthe center piece. Keep them straight to get maximum\nPower for the axe.": "Trascina ogni lama e spina, e rilasciale quando toccano la parte centrale. Tienile dritte per ottenere la massima Potenza per l'ascia.",
 "Be sure to put each blade on the correct side! If you have it\non the wrong side, it will look crooked and won't line up\ncorrectly.": "OK",
 "You need to build the handle of the Axe using a Pole, Grip,\nand Cap.": "OK",
 "Keep each part centered when you drop it for maximum\nDurability. If it's not centered, it will land crooked, and\nwon't be as durable!": "OK",
 "Crafting Shields": "Forgiatura di scudi",
 "You first need to choose a paint to use on a Shield.\nSome paints will have extra Stat Boosts.": "OK",
 "Click and drag across the surface of the Shield to apply\nthe paint. Cover the whole surface of the Shield for\nmaximum Power!": "OK",
 "Keep dragging and painting until the \"Paint Meter\" above\nthe Shield is completely empty. Don't leave any blank spots!": "OK",
 "Place a Crest on a shield to finish it. Keep the Crest centered\nfor maximum Durability.": "OK",
 "Crafting Pikes": "Forgiatura di lance",
 "You need to hammer a Pike blade just like a Sword blade.\nPike blades are shaped differently, so make sure you hammer\non the edges that look like they should be sharp!": "Devi martellare la lama di una lancia proprio come quella di una spada. Le lame delle lance hanno una forma diversa, quindi assicurati di martellare sui bordi che dovrebbero essere affilati!",
 "You build a Pike handle just like an Axe handle, but it's\nmuch longer! You'll need to use more Poles and Grips\nto build one.": "OK",
 "Crafting Maces": "Forgia le mazze",
 "Drag all of the Pegs or Spikes onto the\nMace head to attach them.": "OK",
 "There is a picture showing how each Mace type should\nhave its spikes arranged. Try to make it look like\nthat picture!": "OK",
 "Arrange the spikes correctly for maximum Power!": "OK",
 "Be careful with the Battle Mace -- its spikes need to be\nattached differently than the other two!": "OK",
 "Element Chart": "OK",
 "How long a weapon lasts before breaking": "OK",
 "Luck": "OK",
 "Chance to make enemies drop more loot\nor better loot": "OK",
 "Fire": "OK",
 "Fire Boosts only deal extra damage to\nFire Enemies": "OK",
 "Water": "OK",
 "Water Boosts only deal extra damage to\nWater Enemies": "OK",
 "Ice": "OK",
 "Ice Boosts only deal extra damage to\nIce Enemies": "OK",
 "Stone": "OK",
 "Stone Boosts only deal extra damage to\nStone Enemies": "OK",
 "Wind": "OK",
 "Wind Boosts only deal extra damage to\nWind Enemies": "OK",
 "Lightning": "OK",
 "Lightning Boosts only deal extra damage to\nLightning Enemies": "OK",
 "Plant": "Pianta",
 "Plant Boosts only deal extra damage to\nPlant Enemies": "OK",
 "Shadow": "OK",
 "Shadow Boosts only deal extra damage to\nShadow Enemies": "OK",
 "(Basic)": "OK",
 "Symbol used when an enemy is not an\nElemental Enemy": "OK",
 "Weapon Parts": "OK",
 "Fire Boost +7": "OK",
 "Many parts will give Elemental Boosts to your weapons.": "OK",
 "You own 1 of these": "OK",
 "If you attach a part poorly, you may not get the full\nElemental Boost amount, so be careful!": "OK",
 "Used in an Epic Weapon Design\nthat you've collected in Battle": "OK",
 "Weapon Boosts": "OK",
 "Each weapon variation comes with different Elemental Boosts.": "OK",
 "If you make a great weapon, that variation's Star Meter\nwill start to fill up. When the meter is completely full,\nyou will unlock EXTRA Elemental Boosts for that\nweapon variation!": "OK",
 "Each variation starts with one Boost,\nand has three extra Boosts to unlock\n(Bronze, Silver, and Gold)": "OK",
 "Longswords deal extra damage to Fire Enemies,\nand the Gladius deals extra damage to Water Enemies.": "OK",
 "These Elemental Boosts are added on top of the usual\nweapon Power and Durability.": "OK",
 "Battle Screen": "OK",
 "A: Soldiers' weapons and durability remaining\nB: Enemies on this trail\nC: Current enemy (highlighted)\nD: Enemy Health Bar\nE: Enemy Element\n(will flash when you deal Elemental Damage)\nF: Your cannonballs\nG: Recharging timer around a cannonball": "OK",
 "Enemies": "OK",
 "In the Lowlands, you'll only see basic enemies.\nOnce you reach Cinder Springs and beyond, you'll start\nseeing stronger Elemental Enemies as well!": "OK",
 "Elemental Enemies are each weak against a certain Elemental Boost. Build weapons that deal extra elemental damage for these enemies!": "OK",
 "As you travel further, monsters will get larger and stronger!": "OK",
 "Check the \"Beasts\" Book to see all of the types of\nmonsters you've already encountered.": "OK",
 "Loot": "OK",
 "Enemies will drop loot every time a soldier attacks!\nMove your mouse over dropped loot to collect it.": "OK",
 "When you defeat an enemy, they'll spray extra loot down\nthe trail. This loot usually contains better metals and\nweapon parts.": "OK",
 "If you craft stronger weapons, enemies may drop\nbetter metal ores as loot! When you start crafting Bronze\nweapons, enemies will start dropping some Iron Ore.": "OK",
 "Use weapon parts with a Luck Boost ( ), and\nenemies will have a chance to drop more loot and\nbetter metal ores!": "OK",
 "Treasure": "OK",
 "If you defeat all of the enemies on a trail, you'll reach\na Treasure Chest that has special loot: An Epic Weapon Design\nand the parts required to build it!": "OK",
 "You won't always reach the Treasure Chest if your\nweapons break, so you won't always get a new Epic Weapon.": "OK",
 "Be sure to collect all of the parts that pour out of the\nTreasure Chest, including the Design Scroll!": "OK",
 "Don't worry if you don't reach the Treasure Chest each day!\nThe Design and parts in that Treasure Chest will be\navailable in other Treasure Chests during future battles.": "OK",
 "Cannon": "OK",
 "You will eventually unlock a Cannon for your wagon,\nso you can help your troops in battle!": "Alla fine sbloccherai un cannone per il tuo carro, così potrai aiutare le tue truppe in battaglia!",
 "Click on one of the Cannonball buttons to launch\na cannonball into the field.": "Clicca su uno dei pulsanti \"Palla di cannone\" per lanciare una palla di cannone sul campo.",
 "Large Widescreen": "OK",
 "After you use your cannon, it will need to recharge\nbefore you can fire that type of cannonball again.": "OK",
 "You will unlock some cannonballs that fire at\nyour troops instead of the enemy!\n\nThe Repair Bomb will repair some of\nthe durability on all of your weapons.\n\nThe Booster Bomb will give all of your soldiers a\nboosted attack power for a limited time!": "Sbloccherai alcune palle di cannone che colpiscono le tue truppe invece dei nemici! La \"Bomba di riparazione\" riparerà parte della resistenza di tutte le tue armi. La \"Bomba potenziante\" darà a tutti i tuoi soldati un aumento della potenza d'attacco per un tempo limitato!",
 "Some cannonballs will affect the enemies\ntemporarily!\n\nThe Fire Bomb will slowly deal damage to the enemy\nas the fire burns.\n\nThe Lightning Bomb will zap an enemy's attack\npower for a limited time, so you take less damage\nfrom their attacks.\n\nThe Ice Bomb will freeze an enemy in place for a limited\ntime, so they can't fight back!": "OK",
 "Finding and Browsing": "Ricerca e Consultazione",
 "If you defeat all of the monsters on a trail, you'll reach a\nTreasure Chest that contains an Epic Weapon Design and the\nparts needed to build it. Be sure to collect everything\nthat drops out of the chest!": "Se sconfiggi tutti i mostri su un sentiero, raggiungerai un forziere del tesoro che contiene un \"Progetto d'arma epica\" e i pezzi necessari per costruirlo. Assicurati di raccogliere tutto ciò che cade dal forziere!",
 "Click the \"Designs\" book to browse through any\nWeapon Designs you've collected.\nYou can also press D on the keyboard, or go to the\nDesigns page from the MENU button.": "Clicca sul libro \"Progetti\" per sfogliare tutti i \"Progetti d'arma\" che hai raccolto. Puoi anche premere D sulla tastiera, oppure andare alla pagina \"Progetti\" dal pulsante MENU.",
 "A: Tabs for different weapon types\nB: List of designs found for this weapon type\nC: Parts needed to build this weapon\nD: Bonus Effect given to soldiers when you build this\nE: Bookmark Button": "OK",
 "Design names will be shown in GREEN in the list if youcurrently have all of the parts and metals needed to build it.": "OK",
 "Design names will have a Star if you've built at least one\nof this Epic Weapon before.": "OK",
 "Bonus Effects": "OK",
 "Each Epic Weapon design gives a Bonus Effect to ALL\nof the soldiers on that day if you build one.": "Ogni progetto di arma epica fornisce un effetto bonus a TUTTI i soldati di quel giorno se ne costruisci uno.",
 "This Bonus Effect is added to each weapon's stats during\nthe battle.": "OK",
 "Need to face some Fire Enemies?\nTry building an Epic Weapon that gives a bonus\nFire Boost to all of your soldiers.": "OK",
 "Even if this weapon uses a low-quality metal, it may be even\nmore helpful to build it and gain the Fire Boost for everyone!": "OK",
 "Bookmarks": "Segna",
 "You won't always have the parts needed to make one\nof your Epic Weapons.": "OK",
 "You can \"Bookmark\" a design's parts so you don't\naccidentally use them on a different weapon.": "Puoi \"segnare\" i componenti di un progetto per evitare di usarli accidentalmente per un'arma diversa.",
 "Bookmarked parts will show a striped background and\nBookmark icon when you're building and browsing\nyour inventory:": "I componenti segnati mostreranno uno sfondo a righe e l'icona di segna quando stai costruendo e sfogliando il tuo inventario:",
 "You can have multiple designs bookmarked at once,\nand you can remove a bookmark whenever you like.": "Puoi avere più progetti segnati contemporaneamente e puoi rimuovere un segna quando vuoi.",
 "Bookmark ribbons will be colored to match the type\nof weapon that the part is needed for.": "I nastri di segna avranno un colore che corrisponde al tipo di arma per cui è necessario il componente.",
 "Swords": "OK",
 "Bows": "OK",
 "Axes": "OK",
 "Shields": "OK",
 "Pikes": "OK",
 "Maces": "OK",
 "Molds will also show a Bookmark icon if they're bookmarked,\nand Metal Ores will show an icon and the amount needed.": "Gli stampi mostreranno anche un'icona di segna se sono stati segnati, e i minerali mostreranno un'icona e la quantità necessaria.",
 "Any parts that are used in an Epic Weapon Design\nyou have collected, even if it isn't currently\nbookmarked, will also show this icon:": "OK",
 "After you craft an Epic Weapon, it will automatically\nremove that bookmark (if it was bookmarked).": "Dopo aver creato un'arma epica, il segna verrà rimosso automaticamente (se era stato segnato).",
 "If a part is used in Epic Weapon Designs you have\ncollected, but you've already made those designs at\nleast once, it will instead show this icon:": "OK",
 "Use those small scroll symbols to decide if you want to save\na part to use in a Design later, or if something is safe\nto use in your current weapon.": "OK",
 "Saving": "Salvato",
 "After you start a game, your progress is automatically\nsaved after completing each battle!": "OK",
 "Your game progress is saved directly to your computer.": "OK",
 "If you are having trouble saving your progress, make sure\nyou have plenty of storage space available so there is room\nfor your game progress to be saved.": "OK",
 "App Settings": "OK",
 "You can change how the game is displayed on your computer\nwithin the App Settings screen.": "OK",
 "Press the button while playing to open App Settings.": "OK",
 "You can also press the Escape key on your keyboard to open\nthe App Settings screen at any time, and you can also find\nthe button on the title screen.": "OK",
 "You can change whether you want the game to appear\nFull Screen, and can change the window size between\nvarious widescreen and classic (square) sizes.": "OK",
 "If your computer is having issues where the game is\nrunning slowly, you can change the Graphics Quality to\nlower settings to improve performance.": "OK",
 "You can also display the game in smaller window sizes\nif you are having performance issues with how the game\nis running on your computer.": "OK",
 "There are options to mute the music, mute sound effects,\nchange master volume, and quit the app from this menu.": "OK",
 "Gameplay Settings": "OK",
 "You can adjust some gameplay settings\nfrom the SETTINGS menu.": "OK",
 "If you disable \"Screen Shake\", the screen will no longer\nshake when hammering weapons or during battle.": "OK",
 "When forging metals, the Pull Chain is tailored for easy\nmouse controls, especially when playing at full screen.": "Durante la forgiatura dei metalli, la catena è ottimizzata per un facile controllo con il mouse, soprattutto a schermo intero.",
 "If you'd like to make the chain follow your mouse exactly,\nor if you're using a touch screen, you can disable\nthe \"Easy-to-Drag Forge Chain\" option.": "Se desideri che la catena segua esattamente il mouse, oppure se usi un touchscreen, puoi disattivare l'opzione \"Catena di forgiatura facile da trascinare\".",
 "Keyboard Shortcuts": "OK",
 "You can use Keyboard Shortcuts to switch between screens\nwhile crafting weapons.": "OK",
